A VM in Subscription-A can send logs to a Log Analytics Workspace in Subscription-B.
This is VERY common in enterprises.
You do NOT need separate workspaces per subscription.

REAL ENTERPRISE THINKING
Large organizations usually have:
Many subscriptions
Many resource groups
Many AKS clusters
Many VMs
Many environments

If each resource has separate workspace:
monitoring chaos
difficult querying
expensive
poor governance
So enterprises centralize logs.

