VERY IMPORTANT INTERVIEW QUESTION
Question

How can VM in one subscription send logs to workspace in another subscription?

Strong Answer

Azure Monitor telemetry is sent through Azure Monitor ingestion endpoints over HTTPS rather
than direct subscription-level communication. Azure Monitor Agent authenticates using 
Azure AD identities and sends telemetry based on Data Collection Rule configuration 
into the target Log Analytics Workspace, even across subscriptions, 
provided RBAC permissions and network access are properly configured.

That is a VERY strong senior answer.

