Most enterprises use:
| Component            | Design                            |
| -------------------- | --------------------------------- |
| Central workspace    | dedicated monitoring subscription |
| AMA                  | on VMs/AKS                        |
| DCR                  | centralized policy                |
| Private Link         | secure telemetry                  |
| Sentinel             | centralized SIEM                  |
| RBAC                 | controlled access                 |
| Hub-spoke networking | enterprise connectivity           |

IMPORTANT DIFFERENCE

| Concept                 | Meaning                     |
| ----------------------- | --------------------------- |
| Cross-subscription      | management separation       |
| Cross-network           | VNet communication          |
| Azure Monitor ingestion | Azure service communication |

These are different things.

